["Can or cannot with 得 and 不","Verb + 得 / 不 + result","Put 得 (de) between a verb and its result to say the result is possible. Put 不 (bù) there to say it is not possible.",[["我","wǒ","I, me"],["听","tīng","to listen"],["不","bù","not"],["懂","dǒng","to understand"],["。","",""]],"I cannot understand what I hear."],
["If … then with 如果…就","如果 + condition，就 + result","如果 (rúguǒ) means “if”. 就 (jiù) in the second part means “then”.",[["如果","rúguǒ","if"],["下雨","xià yǔ","to rain"],["，","",""],["我","wǒ","I, me"],["就","jiù","then, right away"],["不","bú","not"],["去","qù","to go"],["。","",""]],"If it rains, I will not go."],
["Two actions at once with 一边…一边","Subject + 一边 + verb + 一边 + verb","一边 … 一边 (yìbiān … yìbiān) joins two actions that happen at the same time.",[["我","wǒ","I, me"],["一边","yìbiān","at the same time"],["吃饭","chī fàn","eat"],["一边","yìbiān","at the same time"],["看","kàn","to look"],["电视","diànshì","television"],["。","",""]],"I watch TV while I eat."],
["First … then with 先…然后","先 + verb，然后 + verb","先 (xiān) means “first”. 然后 (ránhòu) means “then”. They show the order of two actions.",[["我","wǒ","I, me"],["先","xiān","first"],["吃饭","chī fàn","eat"],["，","",""],["然后","ránhòu","then"],["看","kàn","to look"],["电视","diànshì","television"],["。","",""]],"I eat first, then I watch TV."],
["Both … and with 又…又","又 + adjective + 又 + adjective","又 … 又 (yòu … yòu) says that something has two qualities at the same time.",[["这","zhè","this"],["个","ge","(general measure word)"],["苹果","píngguǒ","apple"],["又","yòu","again, also"],["大","dà","big"],["又","yòu","again, also"],["甜","tián","sweet"],["。","",""]],"This apple is big and sweet."],
["More and more with 越来越","越来越 + adjective","越来越 (yuè lái yuè) means “more and more”. It shows a change over time.",[["天气","tiānqì","weather"],["越","yuè","more"],["来","lái","(link)"],["越","yuè","more"],["冷","lěng","cold"],["了","le","(completed)"],["。","",""]],"The weather is getting colder and colder."]
